WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:32.945
Eddy saw his friends at school.

2
00:00:32.946 --> 00:00:44.447
"Hi, Eddy!" called Poppy.

3
00:00:44.448 --> 00:00:49.016
Honk! Honk! She tooted her horn.

4
00:00:49.016 --> 00:00:51.530
Eddy laughed.

5
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.580
Poppy was always silly.

6
00:00:57.887 --> 00:01:00.855
"Field trip today," said Dipper.

7
00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:03.750
"Yay!" said Poppy.

8
00:01:03.866 --> 00:01:06.659
"Where are we going?"

9
00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:10.590
"Maybe to a construction site," said Jeb.

10
00:01:12.111 --> 00:01:15.071
Eddy saw the teacher.

11
00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.400
"Good morning," said Mr. Grill.

12
00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:21.000
"Ready for our field trip?"

13
00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.220
"Yes!" said Poppy.

14
00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.480
"Where are we going?" asked Zippy.

15
00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:31.000
"It's a surprise," said Mr. Grill.

16
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.840
"Everyone, follow me!"

17
00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:37.580
"Yay!" the students cheered.

18
00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:51.566
Honk! Honk! Vroom!

19
00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.000
They turned into a parking lot.

20
00:02:00.898 --> 00:02:04.648
Eddy saw a blue building.

21
00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.970
The building was noisy.

22
00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:11.693
A sign said Car Wash.

23
00:02:11.693 --> 00:02:14.189
Mr. Grill smiled.

24
00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:16.570
"It's bath time!"
